        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">The common thread: these products all require the viewer to understand something before they'll convert. A supplement brand can sell on emotion alone. A SaaS product cannot &mdash; the viewer needs to see the interface, understand the workflow, and believe it will save them time or effort. Tech UGC is the bridge between "I've heard of it" and "I understand how it works."</p>
