        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-[20px] tracking-[-0.01em] mt-8 mb-3">Why Tech UGC outperforms brand content</h3>
        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">UGC drives conversion rates 79% higher than polished brand content for products that require downloads or signups. The reason is trust and context: a real person demonstrating a product in a real workflow is more credible than a brand's own marketing. The viewer sees someone like them solving a problem they have.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">For tech products specifically, the educational element compounds this effect. The viewer not only trusts the creator's recommendation &mdash; they also understand how to use the product before they've even downloaded it. The onboarding starts in the ad.</p>

        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-[20px] tracking-[-0.01em] mt-8 mb-3">Key metrics by delivery model</h3>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-card mb-6">
