            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-[20px] tracking-[-0.01em] mt-8 mb-3">The 3-second rule</h3>
        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">Across both paid and organic delivery, retention past 3 seconds is the strongest early predictor of overall performance. If the hook doesn't stop the scroll within 3 seconds, the rest of the content doesn't matter. For Tech UGC specifically, this means showing a concrete result or a surprising interface moment immediately &mdash; not starting with a slow introduction.</p>
